  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe behavior of scroll restoration with the navigation feels inconsistent. Here's a simple demo with two pages that can scroll: https://stackblitz.com/edit/stackblitz-starters-dznnfgtu?description=HTML/CSS/JS%20Starter&file=script.js,package.json,index.html&terminalHeight=10&title=Static%20Starter\n\nI would expect that push navigation go to the top of the page and traversals restore scroll position to where they were when navigating away from the page but that doesn't seem to be what's happening.",
